  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 1601.03 Co-Disposal of Wastes",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 1601.03 Co-Disposal of Wastes. Hazardous waste as defined in RSA 147-A:2, VII and solid waste as defined in RSA 149-M:4, XXII, except for wood ash certified for use under Env-Sw 1700 and waste derived products certified for use under Env-Sw 1500, shall not be disposed or processed at a site or facility permitted by these rules.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 and Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 1600) #13944, eff 4-27-24",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/env-wq1600.html"
